re meaningful. Explore career pathways that connect CSM programs to real professions, helping you discover where your interests can take you. Explore CaReers Home ◆ Academics ◆ Career Pathways Explore Career Pathways Career pathways help you see how academic programs connect to real careers. Each pathway highlights the degrees, experiences, and opportunities that prepare students for specific professional fields. Healthcare Prepare for meaningful careers in patient care, therapy, and a wide range of healthcare and health sciences. Business Lead organizations and build successful careers in marketing, finance, management, and organizational leadership. Education Teach, mentor, and inspire the next generation while shaping the future of learning and leadership. Human Services Support individuals and communities through counseling, advocacy, and programs that strengthen well-being. Science Explore discovery, research, and careers in healthcare, laboratory science, and scientific innovation. Law & Legal Services Develop legal knowledge and skills for careers in law, public policy, legal services, and advocacy across many sectors. In this section Academics Career Pathways Business Education Healthcare Human Services Law & Legal Services Sciences Mercy Core Curriculum Honors Program Outcomes & Pass Rates Internships Study Abroad Library Registrar Get Ready To Join Us Wherever you’re starting from, we’ll help you build a future with confidence. Visit campus Virtual tour Ask Admissions Apply 7000 Mercy Road Omaha, Nebraska 68106-2377 (402) 399-2400 (800) 926-5534 Campus Map Our Mission Campus Store Events Media Community Employment Directory Facility Rental Complaint Processes Privacy & Terms of Use Connect With Us Facebook Instagram LinkedIn YouTube TikTok Snapchat Pinterest Copyright © 2026 College of Saint Mary. All rights reserved."
