    "https://www.csm.edu/academics/career-pathways/healthcare/": {
      "title": "Exploring Healthcare Career Paths",
      "description": "Healthcare Pathways - College of Saint Mary Skip to content Academics Academics Overview Majors & Programs Career Pathways Mercy Core Curriculum Honors Program Outcomes & Pass Rates Internships Study Abroad Library Registrar Admissions Admissions Overview Visit Campus First-Year Students Transfer Students Graduate Students International Students Admitted Students Parent Resources Tuition & Aid Tuition & Aid Overview Undergraduate Tuition & Fees Graduate Tuition & Fees Financial Aid Scholarships FAFSA 101 Student Accounts Athletics Campus Life Campus Life Overview New Student Experience Student Success Housing Dining Center Clubs and Orgs Faith and Service Campus Inclusion Health & Wellbeing Campus Safety About About Overview Mission History Sisters of Mercy Our Catholic Identity Women’s College Office of the President College Leadership Awards & Recognition Campus Map News Alumni Alumni Overview Homecoming Journeys Magazine Alumni Perks Stay Connected MyCSM Apply Visit Give Search MyCSM Apply Visit Give Search Academics Academics Overview Majors & Programs Career Pathways Mercy Core Curriculum Honors Program Outcomes & Pass Rates Internships Study Abroad Library Registrar Admissions Admissions Overview Visit Campus First-Year Students Transfer Students Graduate Students International Students Admitted Students Parent Resources Tuition & Aid Tuition & Aid Overview Undergraduate Tuition & Fees Graduate Tuition & Fees Financial Aid Scholarships FAFSA 101 Student Accounts Athletics Campus Life Campus Life Overview New Student Experience Student Success Housing Dining Center Clubs and Orgs Faith and Service Campus Inclusion Health & Wellbeing Campus Safety About About Overview Mission History Sisters of Mercy Our Catholic Identity Women’s College Office of the President College Leadership Awards & Recognition Campus Map News Alumni Alumni Overview Homecoming Journeys Magazine Alumni Perks Stay Connected Exploring Healthcare Career Paths Healthcare is a broad and growing field with many paths to make a difference. Students can choose from a variety of programs that prepare them for careers in patient care, rehabilitation, health sciences, and healthcare leadership. Home ◆ Academics ◆ Career Pathways ◆ Healthcare FinD your Calling Nursing + CSM has a long tradition of preparing compassionate, skilled patient care professionals. Rooted in our Mercy mission, this path combines rigorous coursework with hands-on clinical experience so you graduate ready to care for patients, serve communities, and lead in healthcare settings. Traditional BSN (Nursing) LPN to BSN (Nursing) Practical nursing certficate Physical & Occupational Therapy + Start your path at CSM and continue into advanced study. These programs focus on human movement, recovery, and helping people regain independence and improve quality of life. rehab sciences Kinesiology & Exercise Science Psychology (Pre-OTD) doctor of physical therapy occupational therapy doctorate Advanced Medical Practice (Pre-Med) + Build a strong science foundation while getting guided support preparing for graduate and professional programs, whether you’re headed toward medicine, physician assistant studies, dentistry, or veterinary medicine.s. Pre-Health pre-veterinary Pre-PA Psychology (Neuroscience) Masters of Science in Physicians Assistant studies Healthcare Administration + Healthcare needs leaders who understand both patient care and operations. This path prepares you to manage healthcare systems, lead teams, and improve how care gets delivered. Healthcare Administration Human Services + Support individuals and families through advocacy, counseling support, and community-based work that strengthens communities and improves well-being. PsychologY Exercise Science & Sport Performance + Focus on human movement, fitness, and performance, learning how to improve health, prevent injury, and help people or athletes reach their physical potential. Kinesiology & Exercise Science Is healthcare right for you? Healthcare might be right for you if you: Are drawn to hands-on, patient-focused work Want strong demand and real career growth Want to make a meaningful difference in people’s lives Enjoy science and solving complex problems Care about improving health in your community CSM IS KNOWN for HEALTHCARE CSM has a long tradition of preparing women for careers in healthcare. Small classes, expert faculty, and strong clinical partnerships create a supportive learning environment where students gain the skills and confidence needed to succeed. Personalized Learning Small classes and dedicated faculty mentorship ensure students receive individualized support, helping them build confidence, master clinical skills, and prepare for healthcare careers. Hands-On Experience Students gain real-world experience through clinical placements, simulation labs, internships, and partnerships with healthcare providers across the region. Purpose-Driven Leadership Rooted in the Mercy tradition, CSM prepares healthcare professionals who lead with compassion, integrity, and a commitment to improving the health of communities. Numbers that Matter College of Saint Mary graduates are well prepared to succeed in healthcare professions. Program outcomes 100% Job Placement for Nursing Graduates Every BSN graduate from recent cohorts was successfully employed in a nursing role within six months of graduation. 500+ Clinical Sites Across CSM Healthcare Programs Our extensive network allows for personalized placement support aligned with individual interests and career goals. 100+ Of Healthcare Education at College of Saint Mary For more than a century, College of Saint Mary has prepared skilled, compassionate healthcare professionals. Request More Information Wherever you’re starting from, we’ll help you build a future with confidence. \" * \" indicates required fields First Name * Last Name * Student Type * Choose One High School Transfer Parent/Guardian of Prospective Student Email * Phone * Program of Interest * Choose One Art Biology Business Chemistry Education English Humanities Kinesiology & Exercise Science Legal Studies / Pre-Law Math Medical Laboratory Science Nursing Pre-DPT Pre-Health Pre-OTD Pre-PA Psychology Rehab Science Undecided Nursing Program * Choose One Traditional BSN LPN to BSN Practical Nursing Certificate Anticipated Start Date * Choose One Fall 2027 Fall 2028 Fall 2029 Anticipated Start Date * Choose One Spring 2027 Fall 2027 Spring 2028 Fall 2028 High School Name * Previous School * This field is hidden when viewing the form Lead Source CSM Website This field is hidden when viewing the form Record Type – Parent This field is hidden when viewing the form Record Type – Student This field is hidden when viewing the form rfi_ga_source This field is hidden when viewing the form rfi_ga_medium This field is hidden when viewing the form rfi_ga_campaign This field is hidden when viewing the form rfi_ga_content This field is hidden when viewing the form rfi_ga_term This field is hidden when viewing the form rfi_ga_clientId This field is hidden when viewing the form rfi_ga_gclid This field is hidden when viewing the form rfi_ga_ttid This field is hidden when viewing the form rfi_ga_utm_id This field is hidden when viewing the form rfi_ga_msclkid Healthcare is a broad, growing field with many paths to make a difference. Choose from programs preparing you for careers in patient care, rehabilitation, health sciences, and healthcare leadership. 7000 Mercy Road Omaha, Nebraska 68106-2377 (402) 399-2400 (800) 926-5534 Campus Map Our Mission Campus Store Events Media Community Employment Directory Facility Rental Complaint Processes Privacy & Terms of Use Connect With Us Facebook Instagram LinkedIn YouTube TikTok Snapchat Pinterest Copyright © 2026 College of Saint Mary. All rights reserved. Notifications"
